rooms_desc ({"You have a strange feeling... you should enter eastern door, but you can`t !Maybe it`s just for Nassa and his best friends ? You are dreaming whatcould be there.... yeahhh, but you will never find it out !","Hmmmm..... this is a special kithen. As Nassa can`t cook very well , there are just two items here , telephone and paper full of numbers :0042 0831 28033 : dial to order small pizza0042 0831 29812 : dial to order midle pizza0042 0831 28039 : dial to order huge pizza0042 0831 22098 : dial to call Nassa to eat all pizzas you have ordered !!","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","What do you wanna know more ? This is just simple WC !","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,})
